    "rich_text_Mc8MwN": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_tkA7gp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Tired of Handing Your £100K - £5M+ Luxury Car to Detailers Who Treat it Like a Toyota Corolla?</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_TGpqBp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Listen… you didn’t drop insane money on a McLaren, Ferrari, Lamborghini or Rolls just to watch some “mobile valeter” swirl a dirty microfibre over it, leave holograms, miss the crevices, and call it “premium detailing.”<br/>You know the feeling.<br/>You collect your pride and joy…<br/>It looks “okay” from 10 feet away…<br/>But up close? Swirls. Water spots. Dull paint that doesn’t pop under lights.<br/>Inside? Dust in vents, leather not supple, screens fingerprint city.<br/>And the worst part?<br/>They charged you top money for mediocre.<br/>Most detailers work to a checklist and a timer.<br/>They stop when the clock says so - not when the car is actually flawless.<br/>That stops right now - if you choose the company trusted by actual supercar clientele.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
