      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_e9dTeB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Maintenance Detailing",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>from £100<br/></strong><br/>We don’t just “clean”.<br/>We resurrect every inch - inside & out - until it looks better than the day it rolled out of the factory.<br/>Bespoke. In-house or our secure mobile service hits <strong>Oxshott, Cobham, Dorking, Reigate & surrounds.</strong><br/>Your car comes back showroom elevated - not just tidy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GzNAPn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Full Car Detailing",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Price on serious inspection (because every supercar is different)<br/></strong><br/>Forget the rigid “stage 1, stage 2” nonsense.<br/>We let your paint dictate the process.<br/>We keep going - compounding, polishing, jeweling - until the finish is technically flawless and breathtaking.<br/>Swirls? Gone. Depth? Insane. Reflections? Like staring into infinity.<br/>This is the level most owners of real exotics quietly upgrade to… and never go back.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VAEVCQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ceramic Paint Protection",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>£500 (higher for big SUVs - because physics)</strong></p><p>Here’s the brutal truth:<br/>The best coating in the world fails if the prep underneath is rubbish.<br/>We don’t slap ceramic on mediocre paint.<br/>We lock in a flawless base first… then apply elite protection that makes bird droppings, tree sap, UV, acid rain and washing swirls basically irrelevant.<br/>Result?<br/>You stop stressing.<br/>You just enjoy the car again.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
