          }
        },
        "text_GJhiVc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Low-volume on purpose (so your car isn’t just another job in a production line).<br/>We don’t do “tiers”, “packages” or “good enough”.<br/>We have one standard:<br/>Mirror-perfect, technically flawless, jaw-dropping perfection… or we don’t stop.<br/>No rushed shortcuts.<br/>No arbitrary endpoints.<br/>We keep correcting, refining, polishing and elevating until nothing more can be improved.<br/>Because for the cars we touch - perfection isn’t optional. It’s the only acceptable outcome.<br/>So simple - it's a <strong>\"no-brainer\"</strong>:<strong><br/></strong>Secure door-to-door collection & return.<br/>100% success guarantee.<br/>No effort and no risk on your side.</p>"
          }
        }
